  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Myanmar Earthquake Appeal Meikswe Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A powerful 7.7 magnitude earthquake has devastated huge areas of Myanmar.&#xa0;
More than 2,800 people have died and hundreds of people are still missing. Many more have no access to the safe shelter, clean water, food and medical care they need to survive. &#xa0;
Countless roads and buildings have been destroyed, including hospitals, schools and water supplies. Network and power lines are down. People are cut off from vital services.
Myanmar was already facing a severe humanitarian crisis with a third of the population in need of humanitarian aid. Now the situation is catastrophic.</narrative>
  </description>
